@startuml
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU
clock "Clock" as clk with period 100
binary "Enable" as EN
analog "Load" between 0 and 10 as LD

@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low
LD is 0

@100
WU -> WB : URL
WU is Waiting #LightCyan
WB is Processing
EN is high
LD is 7.5

@300
WB is Waiting
LD is 2

@WU
0 is Idle
+250 is Done

@100 <-> @300 : {200 ms} round trip
highlight 100 to 300 #Gold;line:DimGrey : busy
@enduml
